{"indicator":"largest","unit":"人","years":[1950,1955,1960,1965,1970,1975,1980,1985,1990,1995,2000,2005,2010,2015,2020,2025,2030,2035,2040,2045,2050,2055,2060,2065,2070,2075,2080,2085,2090,2095,2100],"projectionFrom":2025,"notes":{"TWN":"台灣最大的城市是 GHSL 的「Taipei」：臺北、新北、桃園、基隆連成一片的市區（937 km²），2025 年 914 萬人；這四市整個轄區的戶籍人口是 920 萬人（內政部 2025 年底）。臺中與彰化、臺南與高雄是分開的城市。城市是連續的市區，不是行政區。","MAC":"GHSL 把 澳門與珠海連成一片的市區算一個城市、放在澳門，人口比澳門全國還多，所以沒有「最大城市占全國人口」。","GIB":"GHSL 把 直布羅陀與西班牙的拉利內阿連成一片的市區算一個城市、放在直布羅陀，人口比直布羅陀全國還多，所以沒有「最大城市占全國人口」。","MCO":"GHSL 把 摩納哥與周圍的法國市鎮連成一片的市區算一個城市、放在摩納哥，人口比摩納哥全國還多，所以沒有「最大城市占全國人口」。"},"notesEn":{"TWN":"Taiwan's largest city in GHSL, “Taipei”, is the continuous built-up area spanning Taipei, New Taipei, Taoyuan and Keelung (937 km²), with 9.14 million people in 2025; the four municipalities as a whole had 9.20 million registered residents at the end of 2025 (Ministry of the Interior). Taichung and Changhua, and Tainan and Kaohsiung, are separate cities. Cities are continuous urban areas, not administrative units.","MAC":"GHSL treats the continuous built-up area of Macao and Zhuhai as one city placed in Macao; it has more people than Macao itself, so there is no largest-city share.","GIB":"GHSL treats the continuous built-up area of Gibraltar and La Línea in Spain as one city placed in Gibraltar; it has more people than Gibraltar itself, so there is no largest-city share.","MCO":"GHSL treats the continuous built-up area of Monaco and the surrounding French towns as one city placed in Monaco; it has more people than Monaco itself, so there is no largest-city share."},"encoding":"delta","aggregates":{"WLD":[3,12553,1957,2260,2608,2317,2587,1630,1297,1380,633,1081,1050,1243,3503,2970,2845,2726,2339,2040,1593,1511,1892,1570,1131,794,365,61,-291,-546,-958,-1130]},"values":{"AFG":[2,2632,514,718,883,1086,1798,3616,3418,4295,2971,5218,5650,4868,5165,9458,4067,6192,4770,4861,3773,4077,3413,3478,2967,2827,2539,2123,1939,1575,1418,1008],"ALB":[1,5907,1562,1971,1417,1627,1477,3049,3